            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[Clicks and highlights work again

- Rows in the list open their card when clicked, and the lit row follows the pointer instead of staying on one it left
- The list opens on its top row, even with the pointer resting over another one
- Selecting what the agent said no longer flickers, and buttons on a card answer the first click
- Got it after What's new goes on to the list
]]></description>
